{"id": "unknown-2026-06-15-013", "date": "2026-06-15", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 25, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["raw_material_energy_cost"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Vietnamese cement exports rise in May 2026", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/vietnam-flag-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Vietnam</strong>: Vietnam exported 3.2Mt of cement and clinker worth US$119m in May 2026, up by 8% in volume and 6% in value year-on-year, according to the latest figures from the government’s National Statistics Office (NSO).</p>\n<p>In the first five months of 2026, Vietnam earned US$610m from exporting 16.6Mt of cement and clinker, up by 17% year-on-year in value and 17% year-on-year in volume.</p>\n<p", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/20874-vietnamese-cement-exports-rise-in-may-2026", "type": "rss"}]}
